ParametricViews::placedView - interconnection rendering (render asInterconnectionDiagram)

canvas size 900×220

attribute signal at (20, 40) size 100×30
attribute gain at (20, 100) size 100×30
attribute noise at (20, 160) size 100×30
attribute output at (780, 40) size 100×30
constraint amplify at (200, 20) size 200×80
  port input
  port gain
  port output
constraint mix at (500, 20) size 200×80
  port a
  port b
  port total

connections:
  signal == amplify.input: = via (120, 55) (200, 52)
  gain == amplify.gain: = via (120, 115) (200, 92)
  amplify.output == mix.a: = via (400, 67) (500, 52)
  noise == mix.b: = via (120, 175) (500, 92)
  mix.total == output: = via (700, 67) (780, 55)
